    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***3 BED 2 BATH / DESIGNATED UNDERGROUND CAR PARK SPACE / DUPLEX / LARGE BALCONY / STORAGE / EXCELLENT LOCATION***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to welcome you to Apartment 14, Block 7, Clarion Quay, a stunning top-floor duplex ideally located in the heart of the IFSC. The spacious entrance hall leads to a versatile office, which could also be used as a cosy snug. At the centre of the home is a stylish walk-through kitchen, fitted with modern appliances and complemented by tiled flooring, flowing seamlessly into a generously proportioned open plan living and dining area. A striking wall of glazing fills the space with natural light and opens onto a large private balcony, perfect for alfresco dining and entertaining. \r\n\r\nFurther benefits include excellent under-stair storage, while upstairs offers a spacious primary bedroom with en-suite, a family bathroom, hot press, a second generous double bedroom and a well-proportioned single bedroom.\r\n\r\nSituated in the vibrant IFSC, Clarion Quay is renowned for its striking architectural design and prime location. The exceptional convenience of this address cannot be overstated, with an extensive range of amenities just a short stroll away. The property benefits from superb connectivity, with an excellent public transport network on its doorstep. Residents have easy access to Docklands Station, as well as Connolly Station for DART and intercity rail services, a variety of Dublin Bus routes, and the Mayor Square LUAS stop located just moments from the door.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is recommended."
      },
